# Core additions to the shared ../Brewfile, selected on every macOS machine.
# GUI applications are selected separately with --personal or --work.
# Linux uses APT for Bash, completion, curl, Eternal Terminal, Git,
# Git LFS, htop, Python, tmux, and wget.
